Sure 👍 Monday test-ku easy-ah remember panna simple React + Tailwind Dashboard Home Page pannalam. இதில் Sidebar + Welcome + 3 Cards மட்டும் இருக்கும்.

1. src/App.jsx replace pannunga
function App() {
  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen bg-gray-100 flex">

      {/* Sidebar */}
      <div className="w-56 bg-blue-600 text-white p-5">
        <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-10">
          My Dashboard
        </h1>

        <ul className="space-y-5">
          <li className="cursor-pointer hover:text-gray-200">
            🏠 Home
          </li>
          <li className="cursor-pointer hover:text-gray-200">
            👤 Profile
          </li>
          <li className="cursor-pointer hover:text-gray-200">
            ⚙️ Settings
          </li>
          <li className="cursor-pointer hover:text-gray-200">
            🚪 Logout
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Main Content */}
      <div className="flex-1 p-8">

        <h1 className="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800">
          Welcome Back 👋
        </h1>

        <p className="text-gray-500 mt-2">
          Here is your dashboard overview.
        </p>

        {/* Cards */}
        <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8">

          <div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow">
            <h2 className="text-gray-500">Users</h2>
            <p className="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mt-2">
              120
            </p>
          </div>

          <div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow">
            <h2 className="text-gray-500">Orders</h2>
            <p className="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600 mt-2">
              85
            </p>
          </div>

          <div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow">
            <h2 className="text-gray-500">Revenue</h2>
            <p className="text-3xl font-bold text-purple-600 mt-2">
              ₹25,000
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

export default App;
Simple-ah structure purinjikonga:
App
│
├── Sidebar
│    ├── Home
│    ├── Profile
│    ├── Settings
│    └── Logout
│
└── Main Content
     ├── Welcome Message
     └── Dashboard Cards
          ├── Users
          ├── Orders
          └── Revenue

Important Tailwind classes:

flex → Side by side
w-56 → Sidebar width
p-8 → Padding
grid → Cards arrange panna
grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 → Mobile-la 1 card, desktop-la 3 cards
bg-white → White background
rounded-lg → Rounded corners
shadow → Card shadow

இதுவே test-ku simple dashboard project. Login page irundhu login pannitu, next dashboard page-ku navigate ஆகுற மாதிரியும் simple-ah next step-la add pannalaam.
